<title>USA: Vanguard Cellular Q4 net loss is $0.09.</title>
<headline>Vanguard Cellular Q4 net loss is $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.09	 loss     $0.04</p>
<p> Net loss	  3,832	 loss     1,820</p>
<p> Revs		74,626		   60,770</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  41,306		   41,320</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.16	 loss     $0.17</p>
<p> Net profit	6,449	 loss     7,013</p>
<p> Revs		282,694		  217,440</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  41,320		   41,100</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Vanguard Cellular Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 net income included a one-time gain of $4.1 million, or $0.10 per share. Q4 1996 results also included expenses of $8.1 million, or $0.20 per share, from Vanguard's share of the losses at two unconsolidated subsidiaries.</p>
